WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Meet Noctra Link. Bring your PS4 to your Windows PC.

00:03.000 --> 00:07.000
Download and extract the Windows ZIP. Open NoctraLink.exe to install the verified engine.

00:07.000 --> 00:11.000
Enable Remote Play on your PS4. Register in chiaki-ng with your Account-ID and a fresh pairing PIN.

00:11.000 --> 00:15.000
Keep both devices on the same network. Connect your controller and select your paired console.

00:15.000 --> 00:19.000
Noctra Link. Free and open source for Windows. Get it at github.com/Soiltary/Noctra.
